        <h2>Get Help and Support</h2>
        <p>If you encounter unexpected behavior, first check the troubleshooting. If you need more help, please email us.</p>
        <p>When requesting support, include details about:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>macOS version and processor type (Intel or Apple Silicon)</li>
          <li>Which input audio sources were added</li>
          <li>Which Monitoring Output and master processors were selected</li>
          <li>The selected file type and encoding</li>
          <li>Whether the app was running in Free Mode</li>
        </ul>
